# Inquiries from 100 personas sampled from NVIDIA's Nemotron-Personas-Korea
# (CC BY 4.0; see personas.jsonl, written by tools/fetch_personas.py), three
# per persona, each followed by what examples/demo.nlu prints for it. The
# first sentence of each persona was written by GPT-6-Luna, the other two by
# Claude, in the persona's voice. These are the English versions of
# the Korean ones in ko.test, in the same order.
# Run them with:
#   ./build/nlu_script_cli --test examples/demo.nlu examples/personas/en.test

# Persona 1: man, 35, 강원 춘천시, 기업 고위 임원
Please unlock the card I locked earlier so I can use it again
    card:unfreeze:Please unlock the card I locked earlier so I can use it again
Please convert the 2,800,000 won I paid at the department store last week into 6 month installments
    bill:installment:Please convert the <amount><MONEY value="2800000" currency="KRW">2,800,000 won</MONEY></amount> I paid at the department store last week into <months><EN_NUMBER value="6">6</EN_NUMBER></months> month installments
I'd like to reset my payment password
    account:password:reset:I'd like to reset my payment password

# Persona 2: man, 50, 강원 춘천시, 기업 고위 임원
Can I switch last month's logistics charge to 3 monthly installments?
    bill:installment:Can I switch last month's logistics charge to <months><EN_NUMBER value="3">3</EN_NUMBER></months> monthly installments?
Could I check how many points I've earned?
    reward:points:Could I check how many points I've earned?
Please add 100,000 won to my Pay Money
    wallet:charge:Please add <amount><MONEY value="100000" currency="KRW">100,000 won</MONEY></amount> to my Pay Money

# Persona 3: woman, 49, 대전 중구, 통신장비 기사
Please tell me where to go to delete my app account
    account:withdraw:Please tell me where to go to delete my app account
Did I meet last month's spending requirement for this month's perks?
    reward:benefits:Did I meet last month's spending requirement for this month's perks?
My card keeps getting declined at the gas station
    payment:failed:My card keeps getting declined at the gas station

# Persona 4: man, 32, 경상남 거제시, 무직
I did not lose it but please temporarily suspend my card
    card:freeze:I did not lose it but please temporarily suspend my card
My phone number changed so please update it to 010-4827-1593
    account:phone:My phone number changed so please update it to <TELNUM>010-4827-1593</TELNUM>
How much is my card bill this month?
    bill:amount:How much is my card bill this month?

# Persona 5: woman, 40, 제주 제주시, 음식 서비스 종사원
I would like to pay 200,000 won of this month's card bill early
    bill:prepay:I would like to pay <amount><MONEY value="200000" currency="KRW">200,000 won</MONEY></amount> of this month's card bill early
I want to talk to an agent not a chatbot
    agent:connect:I want to talk to an agent not a chatbot
Where do I delete my account in the app?
    account:withdraw:Where do I delete my account in the app?

# Persona 6: woman, 47, 인천 서구, 무직
I returned an item I bought at the market yesterday so please cancel the payment
    payment:refund:I returned an item I bought at the market yesterday so please cancel the payment
The magnetic strip on my card is broken so I'd like a replacement card
    card:reissue:The magnetic strip on my card is broken so I'd like a replacement card
I'd like to raise my limit a bit because of my mom's hospital bills
    card:limit:I'd like to raise my limit a bit because of my mom's hospital bills

# Persona 7: woman, 71, 인천 중구, 간호조무사
I would like to change my card payment date to the 25th every month
    bill:due_date:I would like to change my card payment date to the 25th every month
How do I add my debit card to the pay app my daughter installed?
    wallet:link:How do I add my <card type="DEBIT">debit card</card> to the pay app my daughter installed?
Please change what I paid at the pharmacy yesterday into 3 month installments
    bill:installment:Please change what I paid at the pharmacy yesterday into <months><EN_NUMBER value="3">3</EN_NUMBER></months> month installments

# Persona 8: woman, 51, 서울 강북구, 자동 조립라인 조작원
I keep failing to log in to the app even though my password is right
    account:login:I keep failing to log in to the app even though my password is right
I want to pay this month's card bill early
    bill:prepay:I want to pay this month's card bill early
Please tell me how much is due next month
    bill:amount:Please tell me how much is due next month

# Persona 9: woman, 58, 경기 부천시 원미구, 크레인 운전원
I would like to check my card transactions from this week
    payment:history:I would like to check my card transactions from <DATETIME week_offset="0">this week</DATETIME>
I'm at work so please call me at 7pm
    agent:callback:I'm at work so please call me at <DATETIME hour="19" part_of_day="PM">7pm</DATETIME>
I returned something I bought from home shopping but I still haven't gotten a refund
    payment:refund:I returned something I bought from home shopping but I still haven't gotten a refund

